WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,880
Although I expected to refute my words

2
00:00:02,430 --> 00:00:04,030
It's better to do it on the spot

3
00:00:04,310 --> 00:00:06,510
Just standing alone

4
00:00:06,510 --> 00:00:10,460
If you can't do basic movements well, then don't talk to me.

5
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:11,820
What did I say about willpower?

6
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:18,800
You can rest now

7
00:00:19,590 --> 00:00:20,590
two hours

8
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:22,280
No one gets a stick

9
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,820
These thorny bones are pretty hard

10
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:35,950
But my body has reached its extreme. Is it comfortable?

11
00:00:36,270 --> 00:00:37,350
Couldn't be more comfortable

12
00:00:37,510 --> 00:00:39,190
It's more comfortable than going to Chunfeng Tower

13
00:00:39,670 --> 00:00:40,910
I never thought about rest

14
00:00:40,910 --> 00:00:42,110
So comfortable

15
00:00:42,590 --> 00:00:43,590
So comfortable that I don’t even want to

16
00:00:43,590 --> 00:00:45,030
I want these two legs

17
00:00:45,190 --> 00:00:46,830
While you are comfortable, don’t forget

18
00:00:47,190 --> 00:00:48,350
It's time to eat

19
00:00:48,710 --> 00:00:51,790
What if I give you a stick of incense time to eat?

20
00:00:52,030 --> 00:00:53,510
I can't stand up at all

21
00:00:53,630 --> 00:00:54,590
Out of date

22
00:00:54,870 --> 00:00:56,630
If you can't stand up, crawl over there
